<title>USA: Banyan acquires Oklahoma properties.</title>
<headline>Banyan acquires Oklahoma properties.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banyan Strategic Realty Trust said Wednesday it acquired the Oklahoma Apartment Portfolio for about $21 million, including closing costs and other expenses.</p>
<p>The portfolio includes four multi-family residential properties, with a total 864 units and an average total occupancy of 97 percent.</p>
<p>Banyan said it expects a return of about 11 percent of the acquisition price, or about $2.3 million in net income.</p>
<p>Banyan is a diversified real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
